# {{ app_display }}

Almasix application generated with `almasix new {{ app_name }}`.

## Run

```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -e .
smith migrate
smith serve
```

Open http://127.0.0.1:3000

With the venv active, run `smith …` directly. `python smith …` also works via the root script.

## Database

This application talks to **{{ db_label }}**. Connection details live in `.env`;
`config/database.py` names every engine Almasix speaks. The default migrations
create the tables auth, sessions, cache, and the queue need:

```bash
smith migrate
smith migrate:status
```
